<BaseLayout
  title="Mario Kart 8 Deluxe — Is It Worth It in 2026?"
  description="A buying guide for Mario Kart 8 Deluxe on Nintendo Switch: who it's for, what's included, and where to buy it cheapest in 2026."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Mario Kart 8 Deluxe — Is It Worth It in 2026?</h1>
    <p class="meta">Nintendo Switch · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      More than eight years after launch, <strong>Mario Kart 8 Deluxe</strong> is
      still the default party game on Nintendo Switch. It bundles the base Wii U
      game with every DLC track plus the <em>Booster Course Pass</em>, giving you
      96 courses in total. If you own a Switch and ever play with other people in
      the same room, this is the safest $60 you can spend.
    </p>

    <h2>What you get</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>48 original courses + 48 remastered tracks from the Booster Course Pass</li>
      <li>Local wireless for up to 4 Switch systems, and 12-player online</li>
      <li>Every character and vehicle part unlocked from the start (no grind)</li>
      <li>Auto-steer and smart-steering make it approachable for kids and newcomers</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who should buy it</h2>
    <p>
      Families, couch-multiplayer fans, and anyone who wants a game that works
      instantly with zero learning curve. If you only play solo and already own the
      Wii U version, the value is lower — but the Switch port's portable play and
      bundled DLC still make it the definitive edition.
    </p>

    <h2>Digital or physical?</h2>
    <p>
      Digital means it's always installed and ready; physical means you can resell
      it later. Nintendo first-party titles almost never drop below MSRP, so the
      "cheapest" question is less about discount and more about <em>where you have
      store credit</em>. Watch the Nintendo eShop seasonal sales and retailer
      bundle deals around Black Friday.
    </p>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Mario+Kart+8+Deluxe+Switch"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

